As she whispers, she occasionally pauses and produces a soft wet licking sound (舔舐声) — her tongue moving across her lips with a gentle moist sound, clearly audible in the LEFT channel. The licking recurs intermittently, spaced between her whispered phrases. The camera holds the static composition, maintaining the intimate atmosphere. [The scene continues in the same single shot] At approximately 4 seconds, she slowly shifts her attention, turning her head slightly toward the center of the microphone, her whisper moving from the LEFT channel toward the CENTER as she continues: <d>[Chinese] 不要着急… 慢慢来… 我就在这里陪着你…</d> Another soft licking sound, this time subtly panned between left and center channels. Her hand comes into frame, fingers gently brushing the microphone's left capsule as if caressing it. At approximately 7 seconds, she leans even closer, her lips nearly touching the left capsule again, her whisper returning fully to the LEFT channel, softer and more breathy, with more frequent gentle licking sounds between phrases. Toward the end of the shot, the composition settles into the exact pose, framing, and expression established by <Picture 2>: the girl leaning close beside the microphone, her eyes gently closed, a serene content smile on her lips, the warm dim lighting casting a soft halo around her — the scene arriving naturally at the final frame as the whisper fades into a soft breath. [Shot 1 ends on <Picture 2>]\n\noverall_soundscape: Binaural ASMR with explicit channel positioning. The girl's intimate whisper is positioned primarily in the LEFT channel, with soft breath sounds near the left capsule. Intermittent gentle wet licking sounds recur in the LEFT channel between whispered phrases, subtly panning toward center when her head turns. A faint low room tone sits in the CENTER channel. Occasional soft fabric rustle as she shifts. No background music — full diegetic immersion.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A — pure binaural ASMR, no background music, preserving the immersive stereo sleep-inducing effect.", 1344, 768, 73], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 244, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 245, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "first_frame", "link": 392, "label": "first_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "first_frame"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "last_frame", "link": 390, "label": "last_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "last_frame"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "link": 367, "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "link": 368, "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}, {"widget": {"name": "length"}, "name": "length", "link": 248, "label": "length", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "length"}], "flags": {}, "id": 132, "type": "MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"width": true, "length": true, "prompt": true, "height": true}, "Node name for S&R": "MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo"}, "order": 30}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["| 像素（百万）| 宽高比 |分辨率（32倍数） |\n|---|---|---|\n| 0.2 | 16:9 | 608 x 352 |\n| 0.3 | 16:9 | 736 x 416 |\n| 0.4 | 16:9 | 864 x 480 |\n| 0.5 | 16:9 | 960 x 544 |\n| 0.6 | 16:9 | 1056 x 608 |\n| 0.7 | 16:9 | 1152 x 640 |\n| 0.8 | 16:9 | 1216 x 672 |\n| 0.9 | 16:9 | 1280 x 736 |\n| 0.98 | 16:9 | 1344 x 768 |\n| 1.0 | 16:9 | 1376 x 768 |\n| 1.2 | 16:9 | 1504 x 832 |\n| 1.5 | 16:9 | 1664 x 928 |\n| 1.8 | 16:9 | 1824 x 1024 |\n| 2.0 | 16:9 | 1920 x 1088 |\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "像素分辨率提示", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [253.42007446289062, 417.98052978515625], "p